SUMMARY:Hi! PARIS Reading groups “Fairness in AI” – Session 1
DESCRIPTION:The Hi! PARIS reading groups propose studying a topic using scientific articles from both theoretical and practical perspectives. The reading groups are opportunities for interaction between our corporate donors and our affiliates’ academic teams around selected topics of interest. Each edition is planned for 2-3 sessions\, presenting one topic through 3-4 research papers. For each session: present\nhttps://hi-paris.fr/event/hi-paris-reading-groups-fairness-in-ai-session-1/
LOCATION:Institut Polytechnique de Paris\, Palaiseau
URL:https://hi-paris.fr/event/hi-paris-reading-groups-fairness-in-ai-session-1/
