SUMMARY:Hi!ckathon 2026 | The Hi! PARIS AI & Data Science Challenge
DESCRIPTION:About the Hi!ckathon: The Hi!ckathon is a flagship AI and Data Science challenge organized by Hi! PARIS\, the interdisciplinary center for data science and artificial intelligence. Open to students from Institut Polytechnique de Paris \, HEC Paris\, and partner universities \, the competition invites participants to work in teams on a real-world AI challenge with strong business and societal impact. T\nhttps://hi-paris.fr/event/hickathon-2026-the-hi-paris-ai-data-science-challenge/
